The Sonata is a horror, thriller, mystery film directed by Andrew Desmond.

3
00:16:30,000 --> 00:16:36,000
After a gifted musician inherits a mansion after her long lost father dies under mysterious circumstances, she discovers his last musical
masterpiece riddled with cryptic symbols that unravels an evil secret, triggering dark forces that reach beyond her imagination.

